  "reasoning": "The defendant organized and carried out multiple companies to solicit funds from the public by falsely promising high returns and using fabricated project information. The funds were not used for the stated projects and were not returned, constituting the use of fraudulent methods to raise money from the public. Under Chinese criminal law, this conduct is defined as the crime of illegal fundraising (非法集资罪). No other distinct crimes are indicated beyond this primary offense.",
